Files: third_party/Chicago95/*
Copyright: 2016-2024 Grassmunk and the Chicago95 contributors (see CREDITS)
License: GPL-3+ or Expat
Comment:
 Chicago95 v3.0.1 has no licence file. Its README.md ("Code and license")
 states "License: GPL-3.0+/MIT" without saying which parts are under which
 licence, so both are given here. Daytona installs only Theme/Chicago95 and
 Icons/Chicago95 (without the images of the Windows logo and without the
 icons that replace an application's own icon; see
 scripts/stage-chicago95.py), and the "Daytona Cursors" theme generated at build time
 from "Cursors/Chicago95 Standard Cursors" (rescaled to every pointer scheme
 and screen scale, without the cursors that show a parody of the Windows
 logo), in the daytona-chicago95 package with CREDITS and README.md as
 documentation.
 The licence files under Lightdm/ and the LibreOffice icon set belong to
 parts that are not installed.

